        "subject": "Time for your evening wind-down check-in.",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi,\n\nTake a moment for yourself. Fill in your short evening check-in about your screen time, mood, and stress:\n\n{{ $vars.formUrl || \"https://kadoguc.app.n8n.cloud/form-test/sleepwinddown-checkin\" }}\n\nThis is a voluntary, supportive check-in. It is not medical or diagnostic advice and not a substitute for professional help.\n\nSleep well,\nSleepWindDown",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
